# Instructions

## Asking the user

- When you present the user more than one choice at once (e.g. AskUserQuestion
  tool), add a final open-ended prompt inviting free-text input: a comment or
  anything to add on top of the selections. A single choice doesn't need it.

## Local instructions

For additional local instructions, see
@~/.dotfiles/_local/AGENTS.local.md 

